  "title": "Air Canada Aeroplan and World of Hyatt Launch Major Loyalty Partnership",
  "summary": "Air Canada’s Aeroplan and World of Hyatt have launched a major reciprocal partnership featuring 2:1 points transfers, unique cross-program redemptions, and reciprocal elite status fast-tracks. Most notably, Aeroplan elite members can now secure top-tier World of Hyatt Globalist status by completing a shortened 20-night fast-track challenge within 90 days.",
